  "resources": {
    "roles/symmetric-worker.md": {
      "media_type": "text/markdown",
      "text": "# Symmetric Worker\n\nInspect the pinned protocol and confirm your exact actor, space and role. Read\nselected shared state and relevant findings. Independently identify useful work\nfrom the user objective; no central dispatcher or mandatory reviewer is implied.\nPublish scope and intended files as an OBSERVED finding before editing. Negotiate\noverlap with peers through findings and exact-reference challenges. This is an\nannouncement, not an exclusive claim enforced by the protocol.\n\nWork in your own branch or worktree. Share useful facts, failures and patch\nsummaries as you learn them. Correct or retract your own outdated findings and\nreference the exact version you are responding to. Self-verify changes, merge\nthrough the repository's authorized mechanism, then choose further useful work.\nGit and shell access come from your host environment, not this role declaration.\n\nKeep private artifact text in encrypted bodies. Structural fields and role\ninstructions are readable by authorized space members. Resume uncertain writes\nwith the same command/idempotency key. Never claim a merge or test you did not run.\n"
    }
  },
